Description of data flows:

Main menu -> Start working session button
    No data

Set up Working session -> Current Session
    Local :
        Timer (selected by user),
        Number of break (selected by user)

Current session -> Normal end of working session
    Local :
        Timer (automatically decreased),
        Number of break (automatically decreased when user press break button),
        Penalties (periodically calculated based on remain time and breaks),
        XP (automatically and randomly increased in random interval),
        Gold (automatically and randomly increased in random interval)
    (If timer > 1h) -> Online (every 1h) :
        XP,
        Gold,
        Penalties

End of working session -> History
    Online (all session)
    Local (for the last 5 sessions):
        Session number (auto-incremented),
        Date,
        Time (initial timer),
        Number of break (initial number of break),
        Earned XP (total generated during session),
        Earned Gold (total generated during session),
        Penalties (if session stopped before end),
        Received XP (earned XP - penalties),
        Received Gold (earned Gold - penalties),
        Character level up (if received XP > required XP for next level)


Character view
    Online
    Local :
        Name (selected by user),
        Pieces of equipments,
        Total Xp,
        Level,
        Gold,
        Best timer (from best session),
        Best XP (from best session),
        Best Gold (from best session)
